{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"积闭范畴"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"积闭范畴"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>积闭范畴 (Cartesian closed category) 是满足如下条件的范畴 $\\mathcal C$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ 具有有限"},{"Local":{"url":"积(范畴论)","text":"积"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>对任意对象 $X\\in\\mathcal C$, 函子 $X\\times (-)\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$ 有右伴随 $(-)^X\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$, 也即有如下自然同构.\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X\\times Y,Z)\\simeq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Y,Z^X).\r\n$$</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}